    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>267732</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_020_000&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おーおー。
ソーサラーリングを
手に入れただな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oho. You just
got the Sorcerer's
Ring, didn't ya?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>267732</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_020_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ソーサラーリングっつーのは
魔法のアイテムだーよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Sorcerer's Ring
is a magical item.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>267732</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_020_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>とりあえんず、
&lt;SQUARE&gt;を押して、
打ってみりゃわかるだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If ya try pressing &lt;SQUARE&gt;,
you'll see what it can
do pretty quick-like.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>267848</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_020_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ははーんわかっただか？
こんな具合に、
炎の球が発射されんだど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, you've got it, don't
ya? Just like that, ya can
shoot out a ball of flame.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>268136</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_020_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>気になるような
怪しいところがあれば、
まず打って試してみれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If any strange spots
catch your eye, just
try shootin' 'em with it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>268136</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_020_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ひょっとすっど、
先に進む大きな助けに
なってくれるかもしんね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It'll be a big help
as we move
forward, most like.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
